1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,510
It's normal for our bodies to not always be in tip-top condition, whether we catch the flu, have aching muscles after lots of exercise or get travel sick.
我们的身体并不总是处于最佳状态，无论是得了流感、大量运动后肌肉酸痛，还是晕车，这都是正常的。

2
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:19,100
But there's an ingredient that can help with all of that, and it can be used in all sorts of ways.
但有一种成分可以帮助缓解所有这些不适，而且它可以以各种方式被使用。

3
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:26,660
Ginger isn't just something to have in the kitchen – it's been used as an aid for centuries.
生姜不仅仅是厨房里的调味品——它作为治疗辅助品已有数百年历史。

4
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:38,630
Research consistently shows it eases nausea, such as motion sickness, and is recommended as a remedy by the NHS for helping ease pregnancy sickness.
研究一致表明，它可以缓解恶心，例如晕动病，英国国家医疗服务体系也推荐将其作为缓解孕吐的疗法。

5
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:59,675
Anna Daniels, a dietitian and spokesperson for the British Dietetic Association, says it's so beneficial because it has "powerful anti-inflammatory properties which assist with reducing inflammation in the gastrointestinal tract and therefore relieve discomfort and settle upset stomachs."
英国饮食协会发言人、营养师安娜·丹尼尔斯说，生姜之所以如此有益，是因为它具有"强大的抗炎特性，有助于减少胃肠道的炎症，从而缓解不适并安抚肠胃不适。"

6
00:00:59,675 --> 00:01:03,220
And it can help with more than just nausea.
还有，它不仅能帮助缓解恶心。

7
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:12,530
Ginger tea has been shown to help fight colds and flu because it encourages perspiration, which in turn reduces feverish symptoms.
姜茶已被证明有助于对抗感冒和流感，因为它能促进排汗，从而减轻发烧症状。

8
00:01:12,530 --> 00:01:27,700
Gingerol, a bioactive compound in the spice, has been found to help reduce the risk of infections because it supports immune health, including autoimmune conditions such as rheumatoid arthritis and lupus.
姜辣素是姜这种香料中的一种生物活性化合物，已被发现有助于降低感染风险，因为它能强化免疫健康，包括类风湿性关节炎和狼疮等自身免疫性疾病。

9
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:31,210
And if you're sporty, there's good news for you too.
如果你喜欢运动，同样也有好消息。

10
00:01:31,210 --> 00:01:43,750
Studies by the International Journal of Preventative Medicine and The Journal of Pain found that a daily supplement of ginger eased muscle soreness after intense physical activity.
《国际预防医学杂志》和《疼痛杂志》的研究发现，每日补充生姜可以缓解剧烈运动后的肌肉酸痛。

11
00:01:43,750 --> 00:01:46,780
So, how can you use ginger?
那么，如何使用生姜呢？

12
00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:55,460
It's an incredibly versatile ingredient and can be used in almost anything from tea to biscuits to fiery stir-fries.
它是一种用途极其广泛的食材，几乎可以用于任何食物，从茶到饼干，再到辛辣的炒菜。

13
00:01:55,460 --> 00:02:01,390
Many cafes and supermarkets now sell ginger shots promoting health benefits.
许多咖啡馆和超市现在都出售促进健康的姜汁饮品。

14
00:02:01,390 --> 00:02:17,080
Emily Jonzen, author of The Goodness of Ginger and Turmeric, suggests grating it, though she advises "it has a strong flavour and a fieriness to it so introduce it to your cooking a little at a time".
《生姜和姜黄的益处》一书的作者艾米丽·琼森建议将生姜磨碎，不过她提醒说："它味道浓郁，而且辛辣，所以一次少量地加入你的烹饪中。"

15
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:24,700
So, if you like the taste, you could incorporate it into your diet and see if you feel these health benefits.
所以，如果你喜欢它的味道，可以将其融入你的饮食中，看看是否能感受到这些健康益处。
